<title>UK: Bank of America to link with D.E. Shaw - paper.</title>
<headline>Bank of America to link with D.E. Shaw - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of America Corp is planning to link with D.E. Shaw, a privately-owned New York derivatives specialist, to bolster its capital markets business, the Financial Times said on Monday.</p>
<p>Citing unnamed sources close to the deal, the newspaper said the link would be a strategic alliance rather than a joint venture and that Bank of America would not take an equity stake in D.E.Shaw. It had no further details.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
